		"description": "<p>You’re a master at wielding two weapons at once, gaining the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>You gain a +1 bonus to Armor Class while you are wielding a separate melee weapon in each hand.</p></li><li><p>You can use two-weapon fighting with any two one-handed melee weapons&nbsp;so long as neither has the heavy property.</p></li><li><p>When you would normally draw or sheathe a one-handed weapon, you can instead draw or sheathe two one-handed weapons.</p></li></ul>",
